{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4e682e32-22a8-8209-ad3c-7298f5331cd0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T13:32:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I got a streetlight issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It flickers. On and off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is that all the time, or just at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All night. Every night since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The snow and rain one, from Sunday into Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. That one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where's the light? What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "140 Callender Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:30:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "140 Callender, in the North End. Is the pole right in front of that house, or is it down the street a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out front. Right at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Do you see a number on the pole, maybe a little tag or sticker on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. [pause] Can't read it from here. Too high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, the address will do. Is it flickering only, or does it ever go fully dark?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly flickers. Goes dark a few seconds, then back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Any wires hanging down, or damage to the pole that you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Looks normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you send a crew to check the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a work order for that now. They'll look at the pole and the fixture. Crews are still catching up after the storm, so it may take several days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a callback number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0187. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dennis Hanlon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Hanlon. Anything else about the light I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's bright through my bedroom window when it flickers. I'm not sleeping much. I cancelled my streaming subscription to save a few bucks, so I'm just lying there with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll mark it as a nightly flicker so it gets looked at. You're all set, the order's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T13:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
